OL,3,ANobel Prize awarded for showing how
OL,4,Anerve cells shape feelings
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS psychiatrist and neurologist Karl
OL,7,FDeisseroth and his German colleagues
OL,8,FPeter Hegemann and Georg Nagel have
OL,9,Fbeen awarded this year's Nobel Prize in
OL,10,FPhysiology or Medicine for their work
OL,11,Fin the field of optogenetics.
OL,13,FTheir research has helped scientists
OL,14,Fbetter understand how the human brain
OL,15,Fworks.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
